      "content": "thanks for that. for section II, can you give me some specific talking points i can use? i really want to make sure the kids understand the difference between the movements that were actually pushing society forward and the ones that were just trying to block progress or hold onto old, outdated ways of doing things. can you frame the talking points that way?",
